---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Startseite" ogTitle="KI-Recht verständlich. Compliance gelebt." description="Claritas AI Consulting – Orientierung im Regulierungsdickicht. EU AI Act, DSGVO und KI-Governance für Unternehmen.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg-grid"></div>
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-content fade-up">
        <span class="section-label">AI &amp; Legal Consulting</span>
        <h1 class="hero-headline">
          KI-Recht<br />
          <em>verständlich.</em><br />
          Compliance<br />
          <em>gelebt.</em>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-lead fade-up fade-up-delay-1">
          Der EU AI Act, die DSGVO und neue KI-Regularien schaffen erhebliche
          Pflichten — und persönliche Haftungsrisiken für Geschäftsführer.
          Claritas AI Consulting gibt Ihnen Klarheit darüber, wo Ihr Unternehmen
          steht und was konkret zu tun ist.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-ctas fade-up fade-up-delay-2">
          <a href="/termin" class="btn btn-primary">Termin vereinbaren</a>
          <a href="/leistungen" class="btn btn-outline">Leistungen entdecken</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-aside fade-up fade-up-delay-3">
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-num">35 Mio. €</span>
          <span class="stat-desc">Maximales Bußgeld nach EU AI Act für Unternehmen</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-num">§ 43 GmbHG</span>
          <span class="stat-desc">Persönliche Haftung des Geschäftsführers bei Sorgfaltspflichtverletzung</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <span class="stat-num">2026</span>
          <span class="stat-desc">Vollständige Anwendung des EU AI Act für Hochrisiko-Systeme</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Trust bar -->
  <section class="trust-bar section-sm">
    <div class="divider"></div>
    <div class="container trust-inner">
      <span class="trust-label">Regulierungsbereiche</span>
      <div class="trust-items">
        <span>EU AI Act</span>
        <span class="sep">·</span>
        <span>DSGVO / GDPR</span>
        <span class="sep">·</span>
        <span>NIS2</span>
        <span class="sep">·</span>
        <span>KI-Governance</span>
        <span class="sep">·</span>
        <span>Datenschutz-Folgenabschätzung</span>
        <span class="sep">·</span>
        <span>AI Liability Directive</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="divider"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why it matters -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="why-grid">
        <div class="why-text">
          <span class="section-label">Warum jetzt handeln</span>
          <span class="gold-rule"></span>
          <h2>Regulierung ist kein Beiwerk — sie ist Geschäftsrisiko.</h2>
          <p>
            Viele Unternehmen unterschätzen, wie eng EU AI Act, DSGVO und
            die persönliche Geschäftsführerhaftung zusammenhängen. § 43 GmbHG
            verpflichtet Geschäftsführer zur Sorgfalt eines ordentlichen
            Kaufmanns — wer KI-Compliance ignoriert, kann intern haftbar
            gemacht werden, wenn dem Unternehmen Schaden entsteht.
          </p>
          <p style="margin-top:1rem;">
            Claritas AI Consulting verschafft Ihnen einen klaren Überblick:
            welche Risikoklasse Ihre KI-Systeme haben, wo Handlungsbedarf
            besteht, und was konkret zu dokumentieren ist — damit Sie und
            Ihr Unternehmen auf der sicheren Seite sind.
          </p>
          <a href="/ueber-martyna" class="btn btn-outline" style="margin-top:2rem;">
            Über Martyna Kwiecien
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="why-features">

          <div class="why-feature">
            <svg class="feature-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M12 3v1m0 16v1M4.22 4.22l.707.707m13.86 13.86.707.707M3 12h1m16 0h1M4.927 19.073l.707-.707M18.364 4.636l.707-.707"/>
              <path d="M7 12l2.5 5h5L17 12"/>
              <line x1="5.5" y1="17" x2="18.5" y2="17"/>
              <line x1="12" y1="7" x2="7" y2="12"/>
              <line x1="12" y1="7" x2="17" y2="12"/>
              <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
            </svg>
            <div>
              <h4>Risikoeinstufung</h4>
              <p>Systematische Einordnung Ihrer KI-Systeme nach den Risikoklassen des EU AI Act (Art. 6, Annex III).</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="why-feature">
            <svg class="feature-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M12 2l7.5 3v5c0 4.5-3 8.5-7.5 10C7.5 18.5 4.5 14.5 4.5 10V5L12 2z"/>
              <polyline points="9 12 11 14 15 10"/>
            </svg>
            <div>
              <h4>DSGVO-Compliance</h4>
              <p>Datenschutz-Folgenabschätzungen, Privacy by Design und Auftragsverarbeitungsverträge.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="why-feature">
            <svg class="feature-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/>
              <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
              <line x1="8" y1="13" x2="16" y2="13"/>
              <line x1="8" y1="17" x2="13" y2="17"/>
            </svg>
            <div>
              <h4>Dokumentation</h4>
              <p>Technische Dokumentation, Konformitätsnachweise und interne Richtlinien nach regulatorischen Anforderungen.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="why-feature">
            <svg class="feature-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M23 12a11 11 0 0 0-22 0"/>
              <line x1="12" y1="12" x2="12" y2="19"/>
              <path d="M9 22a3 3 0 0 0 6 0" fill="none"/>
              <line x1="12" y1="2" x2="12" y2="3"/>
            </svg>
            <div>
              <h4>Haftungsschutz</h4>
              <p>Beratung zur Minimierung persönlicher Geschäftsführerhaftung durch nachweisliche Sorgfaltspflichten.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Services teaser -->
  <section class="section services-teaser">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-label">Leistungen</span>
        <span class="gold-rule"></span>
        <h2>Was wir für Sie tun</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="services-grid">
        <a href="/leistungen#eu-ai-act" class="service-card">
          <span class="service-num">01</span>
          <div class="service-body">
            <h3>EU AI Act Compliance</h3>
            <p>Von der Risikoklassifizierung bis zur vollständigen technischen Dokumentation. Wir begleiten Sie durch alle Anforderungen des EU AI Act.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="service-arrow">→</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/leistungen#dsgvo" class="service-card">
          <span class="service-num">02</span>
          <div class="service-body">
            <h3>DSGVO &amp; Datenschutz</h3>
            <p>Datenschutz-Folgenabschätzungen (DPIA), Verarbeitungsverzeichnisse, Privacy by Design — rechtssicher und praxisnah.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="service-arrow">→</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/leistungen#governance" class="service-card">
          <span class="service-num">03</span>
          <div class="service-body">
            <h3>KI-Governance</h3>
            <p>Interne Richtlinien für den verantwortungsvollen KI-Einsatz, Risikomanagement-Frameworks und Ethik-Guidelines.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="service-arrow">→</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/leistungen#schulungen" class="service-card">
          <span class="service-num">04</span>
          <div class="service-body">
            <h3>Schulungen &amp; Workshops</h3>
            <p>Maßgeschneiderte Trainings für Führungskräfte, Entwickler und Compliance-Teams — verständlich, nicht akademisch.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="service-arrow">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Process -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-label">Zusammenarbeit</span>
        <span class="gold-rule"></span>
        <h2>So läuft es ab</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="process-steps">
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-icon-wrap" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
            <svg class="step-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="display:block;flex-shrink:0;width:26px;height:26px;">
              <path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/>
            </svg>
            <span class="step-index" style="line-height:1;display:block;">01</span>
          </div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h4>Erstgespräch</h4>
            <p>Kostenloses 30-minütiges Kennenlernen. Sie schildern Ihr Vorhaben — wir geben eine erste Einschätzung.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-icon-wrap" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
            <svg class="step-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="display:block;flex-shrink:0;width:26px;height:26px;">
              <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/>
              <line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/>
              <line x1="11" y1="8" x2="11" y2="14"/>
              <line x1="8" y1="11" x2="14" y2="11"/>
            </svg>
            <span class="step-index" style="line-height:1;display:block;">02</span>
          </div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h4>Analyse</h4>
            <p>Wir prüfen Ihre KI-Systeme, Prozesse und Dokumentation und erstellen einen strukturierten Gap-Report.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-icon-wrap" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
            <svg class="step-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="display:block;flex-shrink:0;width:26px;height:26px;">
              <line x1="8" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"/>
              <line x1="8" y1="12" x2="21" y2="12"/>
              <line x1="8" y1="18" x2="21" y2="18"/>
              <polyline points="3 6 4 7 6 5"/>
              <polyline points="3 12 4 13 6 11"/>
              <polyline points="3 18 4 19 6 17"/>
            </svg>
            <span class="step-index" style="line-height:1;display:block;">03</span>
          </div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h4>Maßnahmenplan</h4>
            <p>Priorisierter Aktionsplan mit klaren Zuständigkeiten — was ist dringend, was kann warten.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-icon-wrap" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
            <svg class="step-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="display:block;flex-shrink:0;width:26px;height:26px;">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/>
              <path d="M12 1v4M12 19v4M4.22 4.22l2.83 2.83M16.95 16.95l2.83 2.83M1 12h4M19 12h4M4.22 19.78l2.83-2.83M16.95 7.05l2.83-2.83"/>
            </svg>
            <span class="step-index" style="line-height:1;display:block;">04</span>
          </div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h4>Umsetzung</h4>
            <p>Begleitung bei der Implementierung: Dokumentation, Richtlinien, Schulungen und bei Bedarf Vermittlung anwaltlicher Expertise.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Banner -->
  <section class="cta-banner">
    <div class="container cta-inner">
      <div class="cta-text">
        <h2>Bereit für Klarheit?</h2>
        <p>
          Vereinbaren Sie ein unverbindliches Erstgespräch und erfahren Sie,
          wo Ihr Unternehmen in Sachen AI-Compliance steht.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href="/termin" class="btn btn-primary">Termin buchen</a>
        <a href="/kontakt" class="btn btn-outline">Nachricht senden</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  /* Hero */
  .hero {
    min-height: 100svh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding-top: 72px;
  }

  .hero-bg-grid {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(var(--border) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, var(--border) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 80px 80px;
    opacity: 0.3;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 80% at 50% 50%, black 30%, transparent 100%);
  }

  .hero-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 360px;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding-top: 4rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .hero-headline {
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 5.5rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .hero-headline em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--gold);
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  .hero-lead {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    max-width: 560px;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .hero-ctas {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .hero-aside {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1px;
  }

  .stat-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .stat-card:first-child { border-radius: 2px 2px 0 0; }
  .stat-card:last-child { border-radius: 0 0 2px 2px; }

  .stat-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 2px;
    background: var(--gold);
  }

  .stat-num {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .stat-desc {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* Trust bar */
  .trust-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.25rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .trust-label {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-subtle);
    white-space: nowrap;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .trust-items {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .trust-items span {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  .sep { color: var(--text-subtle) !important; }

  /* Why section */
  .why-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .why-text p { margin-top: 1rem; }

  .why-features {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-self: center;
  }

  .why-feature {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .feature-icon {
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
    color: var(--gold);
    opacity: 0.8;
    transition: opacity 200ms;
  }

  .why-feature:hover .feature-icon { opacity: 1; }

  .why-feature h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .why-feature p { font-size: 0.9rem; }

  /* Services teaser */
  .section-header { margin-bottom: 3rem; }

  .services-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--border);
  }

  .service-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    padding: 2.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background var(--transition);
  }

  .service-card:hover { background: var(--bg-surface); }

  .service-card:hover .service-arrow {
    color: var(--gold);
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .service-num {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--text-subtle);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .service-body h3 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .service-body p { font-size: 0.9rem; }

  .service-arrow {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--text-subtle);
    transition: all var(--transition);
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  /* Process */
  .process-steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    position: relative;
  }

  .process-steps::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 2.75rem;
    left: calc(25% - 0px);
    right: calc(25% - 0px);
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--gold), var(--gold), transparent);
    opacity: 0.25;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .process-step {
    padding: 2.5rem 2rem 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    position: relative;
  }

  .process-step::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -1px;
    left: 2rem;
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--gold);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 300ms;
  }

  .process-step:hover::before { opacity: 1; }

  .step-icon-wrap {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .step-icon {
    width: 26px;
    height: 26px;
    color: var(--gold);
    opacity: 0.75;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    display: block;
    transition: opacity 250ms;
  }

  .process-step:hover .step-icon { opacity: 1; }

  .step-index {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--gold);
    opacity: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    line-height: 1;
    transform: translateY(-0.12em);
  }

  .step-content h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .step-content p { font-size: 0.85rem; }

  /* CTA Banner */
  .cta-banner {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .cta-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-top: 4rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  .cta-text h2 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.5rem); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .cta-text p { max-width: 480px; }

  .cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hero-aside { display: none; }
    .why-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
    .services-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .process-steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .process-step { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-left: none; padding: 1.5rem 0; }
    .process-steps::before { display: none; }
    .cta-inner { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
  }
</style>

<style is:global>
  .step-icon-wrap {
    display: flex !important;
    align-items: center !important;
  }
  .step-index {
    line-height: 1 !important;
    position: static !important;
    vertical-align: unset !important;
  }
</style>
